From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:16:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] Add a latest messages list to the channel header

A clock button opens the channel's latest 60 messages in the right panel as one list by time,
newest first: root posts and replies to any thread, followed or not. It reuses the pinned messages
list, so each message has jump and reply, and it follows the user to another channel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
